 "strings": [
  "",
  "The death of Jamitov Hymem",
  "threw the Titans into",
  "no small confusion.",
  "Seizing the opening, Haman",
  "moved the fleet out of Axis",
  "and brought the space around",
  "Gryps 2 under her control.",
  "Yet Haman, now holding",
  "the colony laser, failed to become",
  "the complete victor, thanks to",
  "the skill of the AEUG's",
  "de facto commander-in-chief,",
  "Bright.",
  "He stood in for Char, who shunned",
  "the limelight and insisted on",
  "remaining Quattro Bajeena;",
  "as the AEUG's",
  "de facto leader,",
  "he moved its patchwork fleet",
  "with great skill.",
  "As a result, with fleet maneuvers",
  "so masterly that later histories",
  "cite them as a textbook model,",
  "he formed a spherical array,",
  "encircled Gryps 2 and stood",
  "ready to take it in one stroke.",
  "Thus began",
  "\"Operation Maelstrom.\"",
  "Axis Flagship Gwadan",
  "Haman",
  "\"Lady Mineva...",
  " to think you would come",
  " to a place like this...!\"",
  "\"Why did you",
  " bring her here?!\"",
  "Mineva",
  "\"Haman,",
  " where do you mean to go?\"",
  "\"Lady Mineva...?\"",
  "\"I feel sick...",
  " Everything feels prickly.",
  " Please don't go anywhere.\"",
  "Mineva Zabi, Dozle's orphan,",
  "was neither Haman's puppet",
  "nor a pure and innocent princess,",
  "as later ages would have it.",
  "She often showed insight",
  "beyond that of an adult,",
  "taking Haman by surprise.",
  "\"Your insight, Lady Mineva,",
  " never ceases to amaze me.\"",
  "\"It is true that our ship has",
  " now engaged the AEUG.\"",
  "\"That is not it.\"",
  "\"I feel the same unpleasantness",
  " I once felt on the Gwadan.\"",
  "\"I felt it when I saw",
  " Char again after so long.\"",
  "(Ah... is my skin crawling?",
  " So Lady Mineva",
  " feels it as well?)",
  "\"There is no need to worry.",
  " Once the Argama is sunk,",
  " the AEUG is a rudderless ship.\"",
  "\"The rest will go as Axis wills.",
  " Should it come to it, Char",
  " will lend us his aid.\"",
  "\"Char...",
  " He is a man to rely on.\"",
  "\"It is dangerous here.",
  " Please, take your leave.\"",
  "\"I shall come before long",
  " to report our results.\"",
  "\"You will go after all, Haman?\"",
  "\"We shall meet again.\"",
  "A Portrait of Haman Karn",
  "The Truth of the Axis Forces",
  "The leader of Axis",
  "was one Haman Karn.",
  "She was then a young woman of 20.",
  "At first glance she had the cold",
  "beauty of a saber made of ice,",
  "but a girlish charm showed",
  "in her every gesture, and so",
  "she was adored by the troops.",
  "Haman was not a soldier.",
  "Her post was regent to the head",
  "of the Zabi family, Mineva Zabi.",
  "A regent assists a young monarch,",
  "running the affairs of state",
  "until the monarch comes of age.",
  "Her father, Maharaja Karn,",
  "was a Zeon heavyweight,",
  "the great man of his age who",
  "pioneered the asteroid base Axis.",
  "His other daughter, Haman's sister,",
  "was reputedly Dozle's mistress,",
  "but this does not quite add up.",
  "First, Dozle Zabi hardly seems",
  "the kind of man to approve of",
  "a mistress beside his lawful wife.",
  "He was hardly the type",
  "for such juggling.",
  "Also, after her father and sister",
  "died, Haman reportedly ruled Axis",
  "in practice as Mineva's guardian,",
  "but this, too, does not add up.",
  "For a mistress's sister to guard",
  "the lawful wife's daughter is odd.",
  "Rather, it fits better if Dozle's",
  "wife Zenna was in fact Haman's",
  "sister, who for some reason",
  "could not be formally registered;",
  "then the story that her sister,",
  "sickly, died soon after reaching",
  "the asteroid belt, naturally",
  "becomes persuasive as well.",
  "Above all, if Mineva were the niece",
  "of Haman, a powerful Newtype,",
  "her insight, too,",
  "would make perfect sense.",
  "Whatever the truth, she became",
  "ruler of Axis at a young age.",
  "Behind her, of course, stood",
  "the support of adults such as",
  "Char Aznable; Tomler Gelmo, who",
  "had run the administration at",
  "the Zabi family's core; and",
  "Yuri Hasler, known as a seasoned",
  "fleet commander.",
  "But Haman had the capacity",
  "to grasp those adults' counsel",
  "and put it to proper use.",
  "No doubt it was the fruit of",
  "the elite schooling she received",
  "as a child, when she was placed",
  "in Kycilia Zabi's service as a page.",
  "A young priestess-princess and",
  "the lady knight who guarded her:",
  "in the cold, shut-in asteroid belt,",
  "this pair gave the men of Zeon",
  "the hope to endure seven years.",
  "But back in the Earth Sphere,",
  "drunk on seeing her power",
  "move the world, Haman",
  "committed the folly of dragging",
  "the Gwadan into the war's vortex.",
  "That gave Bright, a veteran",
  "of a hundred battles, his opening.",
  "Axis was an asteroid base",
  "that the Principality of Zeon",
  "had developed before",
  "the One Year War.",
  "Since its republic days, Zeon had",
  "been keen on developing space",
  "to offset its scant resources.",
  "As if to fill the void left",
  "when the Earth Federation",
  "lost its interest in space,",
  "Zeon had set out to explore",
  "deep space.",
  "That meant, at the very least,",
  "that among the people of Zeon,",
  "the will to open up",
  "the frontier of space",
  "still lived on.",
  "Solomon and A Baoa Qu, too,",
  "were all that had become",
  "of asteroids Zeon had towed",
  "on its own initiative",
  "from the asteroid belt.",
  "Of the Zeon forces that refused",
  "the One Year War armistice,",
  "most either",
  "turned guerrilla",
  "or else broke away",
  "to Axis.",
  "Tacitly, it must have been",
  "understood as their stronghold",
  "should the homeland be destroyed.",
  "Indeed, Axis was fitted with",
  "a huge city satellite, Moussa,",
  "and on it stood",
  "a beautiful city modeled",
  "on Europe back on Earth.",
  "Their longing for Earth",
  "was far from ordinary;",
  "even aboard the warship Gwadan",
  "they had built",
  "parks, fisheries",
  "and a royal court.",
  "And so,",
  "returning to the Earth Sphere",
  "after a journey of over a year",
  "brought them great joy.",
  "At the time, they did not openly",
  "call themselves Zeon.",
  "This was partly Haman's strategy",
  "of negotiating with the AEUG",
  "and the Titans",
  "to take over the Earth Federation,",
  "and partly so as not to stir up",
  "needless hostility among",
  "the other Zeon remnants.",
  "Above all,",
  "Axis's forces were poorly trained.",
  "Most of them were",
  "student conscripts and aging",
  "reservists who had escaped",
  "A Baoa Qu,",
  "while veterans dating back to Loum",
  "had to be kept in the rear",
  "to handle the training",
  "of new recruits.",
  "To get past this,",
  "Haman chose to stand",
  "at the front herself,",
  "letting her subordinates",
  "gain real combat experience.",
  "She harbored the ambition to build,",
  "before long, the Earth Sphere's",
  "mightiest fleet under her command.",
  "Operator",
  "\"Fifth Unit,",
  " your anti-air fire",
  " is getting in our way!\"",
  "\"The Seventh Unit's MS",
  " can't launch!\"",
  "\"How many units",
  " are on Gryps 2?!",
  " Go ask them yourself!\"",
  "Captain",
  "\"Keep in closer contact!\"",
  "\"If you don't spread out,",
  " you'll just be targets",
  " for their anti-air fire!\"",
  "\"What are you panicking for?!\"",
  "\"Lady Haman!\"",
  "\"We have overwhelming",
  " superiority in strength.",
  " Simply weather the first assault.\"",
  "\"Yes, my lady!\"",
  "\"...A formation riddled",
  " with gaps like this",
  " just invites them in.\"",
  "\"The AEUG... their fleet",
  " moves quickly, it seems...",
  " Hm?\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"I knew it... no doubt about it.",
  " Haman is in there.\"",
  "\"...She'll come out, I know it...",
  " Come on, hurry... Haman...\""
 ]
